		<ANNOTATION>
			<ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a174" TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts346" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts347">
				<ANNOTATION_VALUE>She just stayed? That we just had to stay home and watch the black and white tv? Should never let us go to movies. And really, if you went, you would have to travel to s Augustine or for Laca. So they didn't never allow, allow us to go there.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
				</ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
