			<ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a176" TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts350" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts351">
				<ANNOTATION_VALUE>I don't really know how they really found that place. They didn't really, they, they just decided that they came and I guess loved it. And that's where they settled at? Mm-hmm &lt;affirmative&gt;. At mm-hmm &lt;affirmative&gt;.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
				</ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
