				<ANNOTATION_VALUE>Oh, it was that frightening over there because they were saying that, uh, the, the Ku Klux Klansman and all of those was over there and St. Augustine and they were like fighting and all that. When, um, Martin Luther came and Andrew Jackson and them came to ine and it was just, it was like scary to hear them talk about what was happening over there.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
