				<ANNOTATION_VALUE>Some of 'em said, I was seeing, we heard that they were doing it. But &lt;affirmative&gt; not in Hastings? Mm-hmm. Okay. We didn't have any of that out in Hastings.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
				</ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
