		<ANNOTATION>
			<ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a190" TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts378" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts379">
				<ANNOTATION_VALUE>It was kind of frightening to hear about that, you know? Was it being near where, you know, close to where we lived? Mm-hmm &lt;affirmative&gt;. It was just kind of frightening.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
				</ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
			</ANNOTATION>
		<ANNOTATION>
			<ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a192" TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts382" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts383">
				<ANNOTATION_VALUE>Um, during the time when we were in school, grade school, we were hearing about what was happening in st all the things. Mm-hmm &lt;affirmative&gt;. Mm-hmm &lt;affirmative&gt;.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
