				<ANNOTATION_VALUE>It was just like, hear about that, you know, that were happening over there and all the things they were, people were protesting mm-hmm &lt;affirmative&gt;. And</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
				</ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
			</ANNOTATION>
