				<ANNOTATION_VALUE>Um, it wasn't too long. Okay. Because I would catch the bus off at 2 0 7 and we would take, go into &lt;inaudible&gt; and drop the kids off. 'cause they had the bus that would run from s August Augustine to Palka? Mm-hmm &lt;affirmative&gt;. And from Palka back to St. Augustine, picking up students that attended Alia Blanca.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
