				<ANNOTATION_VALUE>Um, like my grandmother, she really did. And I took up time with her and read a lot with her and stuff like that. I took up time. She was, wanted me to read to her and I would read to her. Mm-hmm &lt;affirmative&gt;. Yes.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
